# Title: Potential Persistence Via GlobalFlags
# ID: 36803969-5421-41ec-b92f-8500f79c23b0
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Karneades, Jonhnathan Ribeiro, Florian Roth
# Date: 2018-04-11
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1546.012, car.2013-01-002
# Description: Detects registry persistence technique using the GlobalFlags and SilentProcessExit keys
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((registry_key_name="*\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\*" AND registry_key_name="*\\Image File Execution Options\\*" AND registry_key_name="*\\GlobalFlag*")) OR ((registry_key_name="*\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\*" AND registry_key_name="*\\SilentProcessExit\\*") AND (registry_key_name="*\\ReportingMode*" OR registry_key_name="*\\MonitorProcess*")))
